==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] for St. Pigge the 2nd and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] for The Face, or any other tanky units.

Several units that can trivialize this stage include [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] for The Face, who shows his worth through his [[Massive Damage]] to Floating, and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]] against St. Pigge the 2nd, with his [[Resistant|Tough]] versus Red.

